                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7683566" data-guid="7683566"></div>
        <div id="questions-7683566" data-guid="7683566" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7683566_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Pursuant to authorization granted by Chapter <a class="xref" guid="7685554" href="7685554#7685554">357</a> of the Laws of 1950 of the State of New York, it is hereby authorized and directed that the lands hereinafter described and heretofore occupied and used by the City of Albany for park, playground and other public purposes located on Colonie Street in the City of Albany be discontinued for such aforesaid purposes.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7683567"
      id="7683567"
