        <div class="notes" id="notes-7683568" data-guid="7683568"></div>
        <div id="questions-7683568" data-guid="7683568" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7683568_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Pursuant to authorization granted by Chapter 885 of the Laws of 1953 of the State of New York, it is hereby directed that the lands within Lincoln Park in the City of Albany and hereinafter described be and the same hereby are discontinued for park purposes for the purpose of using such lands for public school purposes and the construction of public school buildings, including streets for ingress and egress.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7683569"
