        <div class="notes" id="notes-7683569" data-guid="7683569"></div>
        <div id="questions-7683569" data-guid="7683569" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7683569_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The 4 1/2 acres of land hereby authorized to be discontinued for park purposes are situated within that part of Lincoln Park which is bounded on the east by South Swan Street, on the west by Delaware Avenue, on the south by Morton Avenue and on the north by Park Avenue in the City of Albany.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
